qxmpp (1.17.0-0lc1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * LeechCraft CI build of upstream 1.17.0 on top of Debian's 1.14.1-1
    packaging, for the CI images while Debian ships an older qxmpp than
    LeechCraft needs. Bump library sonames to libqxmppqt6-11 and
    libqxmppomemoqt6-11.
  * Follow the build options upstream renamed in 1.15: BUILD_TESTING, and
    WITH_ENCRYPTION (OpenSSL) instead of WITH_QCA; build-depend on libssl-dev
    instead of libqca-qt6-dev and drop qt6-5compat-dev, no longer used.
  * Do not build the API documentation; drop libqxmpp-doc.

 -- LeechCraft CI <0xd34df00d@gmail.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:26:41 -0500

